  {
    "screen": "vault-tool-image-carrier-04",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "在本机 vault-tool 使用 hide，把已有密文与封面图片写成新的载体；取回时用 unhide 指定独立输出路径。也可以在已接通 vault-workflow 的 AI 对话里用技能的 Hide/Unhide，精确指定密文、载体和输出位置，这一步不需要密码。原密文和原封面都会保留，做完载体不代表可以清理它们。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **选定已有密文和封面**　这是给密文加图片载体，先确认密文本身已生成且另有恢复条件。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
